						<HLink nbCells="1"></HLink>
						<contact typeContact="openContact" contactVariableName="hmiShowFp&lt;&gt;0 "></contact>
						<HLink nbCells="1"></HLink>
						<emptyCell nbCells="2"></emptyCell>
						<HLink nbCells="2"></HLink>
						<operateBlock width="4">
							<statement>hmiShowFP:=0;</statement>
						</operateBlock>
					</typeLine>
					<typeLine>
						<emptyLine nbRows="26"></emptyLine>
					</typeLine>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Filterpus even een xsec hoog  laten zien op het HMI
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="69"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="2">The filter pulse is used to blow air in a cloth at the bottom of a tank or clean the filters in a Ventfilter. 
It has 3 valves without feedback and when the input PulseOn is 1 the cycling is started with valve 1 set to 1 for the time set in pulselenght this time is in ms. 
When this time is over the time set in pulsegap in seconds determines the gap before valve 2 is set to 1 for the time in pulselength and so on.
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="0"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">open valves one at a time, first 1 then 2 then 3 enz.<objPosition posX="0" posY="57"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Pulsgap Limit
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="11"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Filterpulse running
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="63"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">reset pulses when off
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="61"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Convert interger to time
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="19"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Pulselength timer
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="30"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Gaplength timer
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="35"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">Pulselength Limit
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="3"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
					<textBox width="11" height="1">open valves one at a time, firt 1 then 2 then 3 enz.
    <objPosition posX="0" posY="41"></objPosition>
					</textBox>
				</networkLD>
			</LDSource>
		</FBProgram>
	</FBSource>
